  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK Humanitarian Support in the Occupied Palestinian Territories</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under this ten-month project, IOM is contributing to the overall objective of meeting the immediate needs and the alleviation of the suffering of internally displaced persons (IDPs) and other affected people in Gaza through the facilitation of coordination and handover of emergency assistance, acting as consignee for FCDO aid items in Gaza.</narrative>
  </description>
